<Slide notes={`空间语义写什么？写这个场所公开的用途和关系。阅读室的语义说明它适合阅读与分享；公共大厅的语义说明它连接各场所并提供公共咨询。

不写什么？不把某位人物私下知道的信息写进公开空间语义。语义是世界的公共描述，人物私下的知情属于人物资料和记忆，混在一起就会破坏信息边界。

层级上，每一层都可以有自然语言语义，但只有 Game Object 绑定对象根 Skill；对象的私有状态同样不属于公开语义。`} style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', flexDirection: 'column', padding: '20px 64px' }}>

    <Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 20 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 44, background: '#276FBF' }} />
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>3.3.3　建立四层地址树</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B' }}>语义写什么，不写什么</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 540, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 32 }}>

        <Box style={{ width: 420, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 12 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B' }}>选中节点，填三件事</Text>
            <Box style={{ height: 86, background: '#F4F7FA', borderRadius: 8, padding: '12px 16px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#276FBF' }}>节点名称</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#546779' }}>给场所一个系统内的名字</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ height: 86, background: '#F4F7FA', borderRadius: 8, padding: '12px 16px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#276FBF' }}>空间范围</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#546779' }}>X、Y、W、H，以格为单位</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ height: 86, background: '#F4F7FA', borderRadius: 8, padding: '12px 16px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#276FBF' }}>空间语义</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#546779' }}>公开的用途与关系描述</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ height: 104, background: '#FFF4E6', borderRadius: 8, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12, padding: '0 16px' }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 72, background: '#CB6B28' }} />
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#CB6B28' }}>不把某位人物私下知道的信息，写进公开空间语义</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#546779' }}>语义是世界的公共描述，私下知情属于人物资料与记忆。</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ width: 700, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 14, justifyContent: 'center' }}>

            <Box style={{ height: 112, background: '#EDF4FC', borderRadius: 10, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16, padding: '0 20px' }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 104, height: 40, background: '#276FBF', borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>阅读室</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#276FBF' }}>「适合阅读与分享」</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#546779' }}>阅读访客的目标区域；说明用途，不写任何人物的私下信息。</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ height: 112, background: '#ECF7F2', borderRadius: 10, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16, padding: '0 20px' }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 104, height: 40, background: '#26816B', borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>公共大厅</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#26816B' }}>「连接各场所，并提供公共咨询」</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#546779' }}>连接房间、查询公告与咨询；公告与服务由对象 Skill 承接（3.4 展开）。</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ height: 150, background: '#F4F7FA', borderRadius: 10, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16, padding: '0 20px' }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 110, background: '#276FBF' }} />
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#276FBF' }}>每一层都可以有自然语言语义</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>只有 Game Object 绑定对象根 Skill；对象私有状态不属于公开语义，也不进入人物初始知识。</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

        </Box>

    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>3.3 从图像到四层空间</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>13 / 25</Text>
    </Box>

</Slide>
